<title>USA: Applied Analytical sees R&amp;D buy accretive.</title>
<headline>Applied Analytical sees R&amp;D buy accretive.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, N.C. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Analytical Industries Inc said Friday it expects its previously announced purchase of a German contract research and development organization to be &quot;modestly&quot; accretive to earnings per share for 1997.</p>
<p>In a press release, Applied said that in a teleconference with the U.S. investment community on Thursday it said the purchase would be accretive.</p>
<p>Applied is buying L.A.B. Gesellschaft fur pharmakologische Untersuchungen mbH &amp; Co for $18 million.</p>
</text>
